{"name":"Brutal mogging","deep":true,"image":{"url":"assets/photos/brutal-mogging.webp","credit":"https://knowyourmeme.com/photos/2654650-starter-packs","caption":"Brutal mogging","source":"Used with permission"},"mentions":13,"casual":{"lead":["To 'mog' someone is to outshine them in looks, and a 'brutal mog' is the intense version, where the gap shows in several categories together, such as face, build, height and style. Looksmaxxers use the idea as a prompt: seeing which areas set someone apart shows which areas to work on, whether gym, skin or grooming.","It is forum vocabulary, not a researched concept. Threads titled 'brutal mog' range from photo comparisons to real-world anecdotes, and the term appears in tier lists ranking how severe a mog is."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["In practice it is a way of talking: posters share a comparison or a story and label it. One post describes a man on a bridge noticed by a passing runner and says it made the author consider starting gym training, an example of the term turning into motivation."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["The term is a ranking vocabulary, and the forums it appears in contain heated and often abusive exchanges, so the label can go with insults. It is subjective and has no measurement behind it."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Brutal mogging experience on the way to school this week.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mogging-experience-on-the-way-to-school-this-week.1400055/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250519120310/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mogging-experience-on-the-way-to-school-this-week.1400055/"},{"title":"Brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1321245/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250220082912/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1321245/"},{"title":"Brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1188945/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241202224918/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1188945/"},{"title":"brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.521698/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220718071606/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.521698/"},{"title":"brutal mog by mike thurston mattdoesfitness","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog-by-mike-thurston-mattdoesfitness.267271/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210822222837/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog-by-mike-thurston-mattdoesfitness.267271/"},{"title":"brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.105605/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240228020816/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.105605/"},{"title":"actual brutal mog on ometv","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/actual-brutal-mog-on-ometv.1791424/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229083310/https://looksmax.org/threads/actual-brutal-mog-on-ometv.1791424/"},{"title":"clavicular gets so brutally mogged brutal mog that even tiktokcels that worship him laugh at him","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/clavicular-gets-so-brutally-mogged-brutal-mog-that-even-tiktokcels-that-worship-him-laugh-at-him.1790022/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229154912/https://looksmax.org/threads/clavicular-gets-so-brutally-mogged-brutal-mog-that-even-tiktokcels-that-worship-him-laugh-at-him.1790022/"},{"title":"mogging tier list least brutal mog to most brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mogging-tier-list-least-brutal-mog-to-most-brutal-mog.625961/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221220075249/https://looksmax.org/threads/mogging-tier-list-least-brutal-mog-to-most-brutal-mog.625961/"},{"title":"strangerdanger vs fuccilife brutal mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/strangerdanger-vs-fuccilife-brutal-mog-battle.585621/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221014020652/https://looksmax.org/threads/strangerdanger-vs-fuccilife-brutal-mog-battle.585621/"},{"title":"giga brutal mogging its completely over","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/giga-brutal-mogging-its-completely-over.448001/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220802174235/https://looksmax.org/threads/giga-brutal-mogging-its-completely-over.448001/"},{"title":"extremely brutal mogging","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/extremely-brutal-mogging.106770/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240617224514/https://looksmax.org/threads/extremely-brutal-mogging.106770/"},{"title":"Study: Fox News Viewers are the Most Misinformed","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/study-fox-news-viewers-are-the-most-misinformed/158433","site":"T Nation · 223 posts · 2010"},{"title":"Islam Logos for US Dept's","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/islam-logos-for-us-depts/147994","site":"T Nation · 89 posts · 2010"},{"title":"consequences","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/consequences/29189","site":"T Nation · 68 posts · 2003"},{"title":"Bush's Trip to Russia","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/bushs-trip-to-russia/47236","site":"T Nation · 11 posts · 2005"},{"title":"Bush's Dissonance","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/bushs-dissonance/87557","site":"T Nation · 6 posts · 2007"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[]},"angle":{"goal":"Confidence & presence","chain":["See where another person clearly stands out","Identify which categories drive the gap","Pick areas such as gym, skin or grooming to improve"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Posters use brutal mogs as reference points for what to improve. One described an encounter that made him want to start training."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Brutal mogging is looksmaxxing slang for an especially thorough 'mog', the act of one person visually outclassing another. Where plain mogging can be about a single feature, a brutal mog is described as a win across several categories at once, such as face, physique, height or style.","Looksmax.org has many threads using the phrase, from titles such as 'brutal mog' and 'extremely brutal mogging' to a mogging tier list ordered from the least to the most brutal.[1][2][3] Posters sometimes use an episode as motivation: one author describes watching a jogger turn to look at a muscular man and says it made him consider gym training.[4]","No research addresses brutal mogging; it is a community judgement rather than a measured quantity."],"infobox":[["Type","Community term"],["Meaning","A mog that wins on several traits at once"],["Related terms","Mogging, mog tier list, dickmog"],["Where used","looksmax.org"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Mogging means outshining someone by comparison. 'Brutal' marks the strong form. Forum titles use it for comparisons of photos, encounters in public, and videos of well-known looksmaxxing figures.[2][5]","A tier list thread ranks types of mog from least to most brutal, showing that users treat severity as a scale.[3] Another thread argues that one particular type is the most brutal of all.[6]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["The vocabulary frames appearance as comparative and multi-factor. A poster describing a woman who looked back at a jogging man for several seconds said it made him seriously consider starting 'gymmaxing'.[4]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Brutal mogging is used on looksmax.org as a label for comparisons and anecdotes.[2][3]","claims":[{"claim":"Being outclassed in several categories at once is the most severe kind of mog","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"extremely brutal mogging","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/extremely-brutal-mogging.106770/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.105605/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mogging tier list least brutal mog to most brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mogging-tier-list-least-brutal-mog-to-most-brutal-mog.625961/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Brutal mogging experience on the way to school this week.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mogging-experience-on-the-way-to-school-this-week.1400055/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"brutal mog by mike thurston mattdoesfitness","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog-by-mike-thurston-mattdoesfitness.267271/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"looksmax.org thread","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dickmog-is-the-most-brutal-mog-by-far.55235/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Brutal mogging experience on the way to school this week.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mogging-experience-on-the-way-to-school-this-week.1400055/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250519120310/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mogging-experience-on-the-way-to-school-this-week.1400055/"},{"title":"Brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1321245/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250220082912/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1321245/"},{"title":"Brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1188945/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241202224918/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.1188945/"},{"title":"brutal mog","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.521698/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220718071606/https://looksmax.org/threads/brutal-mog.521698/"},{"title":"brutal mog by mike thurston mattdoesfitness","url"